If you tell me **which platform/app** you’re using (e.g., ScholarSync app/site, Google Classroom tool, or another site) and what device you’re on, I can guide you to the exact button/path.

Also, which **chapter or topic** in Class 12 Chemistry do you want to start with (Periodic Classification, Equilibrium, Organic, etc.)?"}

